## 6. Package Structure [REN-PACKAGE]

### 6.1 Location [REN-PACKAGE-LOC]

```
ux_composer/
  src/
    composeio_renderers/           # Shared renderer package
      __init__.py                  # Exports: RendererFactory, WidgetRenderer, RendererContext
      context.py                   # RendererContext dataclass
      factory.py                   # RendererFactory registry
      base.py                      # WidgetRenderer base class
      gauge.py                     # GaugeRenderer
      button.py                    # ButtonRenderer
      relay.py                     # RelayRenderer
      coordinate.py                # CoordinateEntryRenderer
      bus_monitor.py               # BusMonitorRenderer
      tab.py                       # TabRenderer
      placeholder.py               # PlaceholderRenderer
```

The package is `composeio_renderers` — importable by both the dashboard (`from composeio_renderers import RendererFactory`) and ComposeUX (`from composeio_renderers import RendererFactory`). It depends on `customtkinter` and `composeio` but NOT on `composer` (ComposeUX internals) or `dashboard`.

### 6.2 Dependency Direction [REN-PACKAGE-DEPS]

```
dashboard ----imports----> composeio_renderers
composer  ----imports----> composeio_renderers
composeio_renderers ----imports----> composeio (bus library)
composeio_renderers ----imports----> customtkinter
```

The renderer package MUST NOT import from `dashboard` or `composer`. If it needs something from those packages, the hosting layer passes it through `RendererContext`.

---

## 7. Compliance Requirements [REN-COMPLIANCE]

A compliant rendering layer implementation MUST:

1. **[REN-C1]** Provide renderers for all six built-in widget types: GaugeWidget, ButtonWidget, RelayWidget, CoordinateEntryWidget, BusMonitorWidget, TabWidget
2. **[REN-C2]** All renderers accept `RendererContext` as their sole configuration interface — no direct dependency on dashboard or ComposeUX types
3. **[REN-C3]** All bus callbacks MUST route through `schedule_update` for thread-safe CTk updates — never modify CTk widgets directly from a bus callback thread
4. **[REN-C4]** Interactive renderers (ButtonRenderer, CoordinateEntryRenderer) MUST publish state changes via `context.publish` — never directly to a transport
5. **[REN-C5]** `RendererFactory.create()` MUST return `PlaceholderRenderer` for unrecognized widget types — never raise, never return None
6. **[REN-C6]** All renderers MUST display a meaningful default state when no bus data has arrived (state engine default value)
7. **[REN-C7]** The `composeio_renderers` package MUST NOT import from `composer` or `dashboard` packages
8. **[REN-C8]** TabRenderer MUST support all three routing modes: `all`, `active_only`, `selective`

A compliant implementation SHOULD:

9. **[REN-S1]** GaugeRenderer SHOULD animate needle transitions (smooth interpolation over ~100ms)
10. **[REN-S2]** ButtonRenderer LED behaviors SHOULD match [CS-LED-BEHAVIOR] visual semantics
11. **[REN-S3]** BusMonitorRenderer SHOULD color-code messages by type
12. **[REN-S4]** Renderers SHOULD be instantiable with a mock bus for unit testing

